// Deploy config for agxtrade.com — the public marketing page.
//
// The site is a static-assets Worker (no server code): Cloudflare serves the
// files in this directory directly, which is why the dashboard reports
// "Metrics is unavailable for Workers with only static assets".
//
// This file lives in web/ rather than the repo root ON PURPOSE. Workers Builds
// auto-detects package manifests in the build root directory, and the repo root
// holds requirements.txt for the trading backend — so a root build tried
// "pip install -r requirements.txt", spent seven minutes compiling pandas from
// source, and failed. Publishing four static files needs none of that.
//
// So the build's Root directory MUST be set to "web" in the Cloudflare
// dashboard. If it is ever set back to "/", the build breaks again on pip.
//
// "name" must match the Worker in the dashboard exactly or every build fails.
//
// Not related to app.agxtrade.com, which is the trading app served over the
// cloudflared tunnel from the nested AgenticAI-Trading 2 repo.
{
  "name": "silent-dream-af05",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-08-14",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./"
  }
}
